    <h2>CS-210 Enhanced Corner Grocer Artifact (CS-499 Capstone)</h2>

    <p>
      This enhanced artifact is an upgraded version of my original CS-210 Corner Grocer project. 
      The goal of this enhancement, completed as part of the CS-499 Capstone, was to demonstrate 
      proficiency in <strong>algorithms</strong> and <strong>data structures</strong> by improving 
      performance, scalability, and functionality.
    </p>

    <h3>✔ Enhancements Included</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Replaced basic counting with <strong>unordered_map</strong> for O(1) lookups</li>
      <li>Added a <strong>min-heap</strong> structure for efficient Top-K frequency selection</li>
      <li>Implemented a <strong>Trie</strong> (prefix tree) for prefix searching</li>
      <li>Improved file I/O and input data normalization</li>
      <li>Refactored code for readability and performance</li>
    </ul>

